		"ItemTooltips"
		{
			"item_trusty_shovel"		"Gives us a bit of health, free salves and tp scrolls. bounty runes if you lucky. Good neutral item for any support"
			"item_pupils_gift"		"+13 secondary stats which is +260 HP and +2 armour for us. Efficient just as 2 bracers are"
			"item_philosophers_stone"		"Good item for any support. Place it in courier"
			"item_quickening_charm"		"Provides us cooldown reduction, which is so good for our low-cd hero"
			"item_spy_gadget"		"Bonus attack range and cast range. Enough said"
			"item_timeless_relic"		"Absolutely best item for us with extra debuff duration and spell damage. Dream coils lasts for an eternity, and we have perma-silence for enemy supports"
			"item_spell_prism"		"Another cooldown reduction item"
		}
	}
